              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man i ceng’ mir apaje i dwi maeni mir abirone wubibedo ku cokri ma leng’; man wubiketho can i ng’eyong’ec mu: wubitimo tic moko ma jumuli kudo ngo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ento wubithiero lam m’awang’a ni Yehova ni ng’wic mido ma ng’ar: thwon dhiang’ acel m’aradu, ku nyog rombo acel, man nyithi nyogi rombe abiro ma rundigi acel acel; gibibedo iwu ma mulima mbe i kumgi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku lam mi mogone, mogo ma yom ma jujebo ku mo, ng’et apaje mir adege mi thwon dhiang’, ng’ete mir apaje ario mi nyog rombo acel, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ng’ete mir apaje mi nyithi rombe kubang’e kubang’e mi nyithi rombe abiro: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyog diel acel ni lam mi dubo; umed lam mi dubo mir adunya, ku lam m’awang’a ma thiri thiri, ku lam mi mogone, ku lam m’amadhane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.11"
            ]
          }
        }
