                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man i ceng’ apar wi abije mi dwi mir abirone wubibedo ku cokri ma leng’; wubitimo tic moko ma jumuli kudo ngo, man wubikwiro agba ni Yehova ceng’ abiro: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man wubithiero lam m’awa ng’a, lam ma jutimo ku mac, mi ng’wic mido ma ng’ar ni Yehova; thwoni dhiang’ m’aradu apar wi adek, man nyogi rombe ario, ku nyithi nyogi rombe apar wi ang’wen ma rundigi acel acel; gibibedo ma mulima mbe i kumgi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ku lam mi mogone, mogo ma yom ma jujebo ku mo, ng’ete mir apaje adek mi thwoni dhiang’ kubang’e kubang’e mi thwoni dhiang’ apar wi adek, ng’ete mir apaje ario pi nyogi rombe kubang’e kubang’e mi nyogi rombe ario, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man ng’ete mir apaje mi nyithi rombe kubang’gi kubang’gi mi nyithi rombe apar wi ang’wen; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man nyog diel acel ni lam mi dubo; umed lam m’awang’a ma thiri thiri, ku lam mi mogone, man lam m’amadhane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.29.16"
            ]
          }
        }
