        {
          "text": "Man i ceng’ mir arionde wubithiero thwoni dhiang’ m’aradu apar wi ario, ku nyogi rombe ario, ku nyithi nyogi rombe apar wi ang’wen ma rundigi acel acel ma mulima mbe i kumgi; ",
          "type": "text",
